    "sections": {
        "description": "The Business Consulting Agency theme is a feature-rich, professional solution designed for consulting firms, business consultants, agencies, individual consultants, PR agencies, market research firms, and crisis management specialists seeking a strong online presence. Perfectly tailored for businesses specializing in business consulting, public relations, crisis management, market research, digital transformation, cloud solutions, and growth strategies, this theme provides an intuitive platform to showcase expertise, case studies, ROI-driven frameworks, and KPI metrics. Whether managing a consulting franchise or highlighting a consulting agency portfolio, the theme’s modern, responsive, and mobile-friendly design ensures a seamless browsing experience across all devices. Customizable layouts, banners, call-to-action sections, portfolio galleries, blog integration for thought leadership, and testimonial areas allow businesses to promote their services effectively and build trust. Ideal for consulting across industries such as education, healthcare, and IT, the theme integrates with SEO tools, social media platforms, and is fully compatible with the Contact Form 7 plugin for client inquiries, consultations, and lead management. With engaging visual elements and professional layouts, the Business Consulting Agency theme elevates any consulting brand, enhances credibility, and drives client engagement."
    },
